# Generated by xcodegen from project.yml, which is the source of truth for all of it. Kept out
# of the repository so there is exactly one place a build setting, a bundle id, an entitlement or
# an Info.plist key can be changed. `xcodegen generate` recreates all six files; the README says
# so, and every script in scripts/ runs it before building.
Dawnbreak.xcodeproj/
Configuration/Dawnbreak-Info.plist
Configuration/DawnbreakWidget-Info.plist
Configuration/Dawnbreak.entitlements
Configuration/DawnbreakWidget.entitlements
Configuration/Dawnbreak-Debug.entitlements

# Everything this project builds, photographs or uploads. Written by scripts/, reproducible from
# a clean checkout, and large: one screenshot run is 144 PNGs at 1320×2868.
build/

# Python's bytecode cache, from the generators and the preflight in scripts/.
__pycache__/

# SwiftPM's own directories, for the kit and for any local plugin.
.build/
.swiftpm/
Package.resolved

# Xcode's per-user state: window positions, breakpoints, the last scheme selected.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint

# Archives and their exports. An .xcarchive is the app, its dSYMs and its bitcode; nothing about
# it belongs in git, and `scripts/release.sh` can rebuild one from any commit.
*.xcarchive
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip

# App Store Connect credentials. The API key is a private key that can upload builds and edit
# listings, so it lives in ~/.appstoreconnect/private_keys where altool and fastlane look for it,
# never in the repository. Listed anyway, so a copy dropped here by accident is not committed.
AuthKey_*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
.env
.env.*

.DS_Store
